OL,3,ABurnham 'ready to support' Poundland
OL,4,Astaff as retailer faces collapse
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndy Burnham has said the government
OL,7,Fwas "ready to support" Poundland staff
OL,8,Fas the retailer teeters on the brink of
OL,9,Fcollapse.
OL,11,FThe prime minister called for answers
OL,12,Fover why an offer to buy the business
OL,13,Ffrom its current owners, which would
OL,14,Fhave protected jobs, had been rejected.
OL,16,F"This is a deeply worrying time for
OL,17,FPoundland staff and their families,"
OL,18,FBurnham told the BBC.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
