OL,3,ABurnham 'ready to support' Poundland
OL,4,Astaff as retailer faces collapse
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe discount chain is teetering on the
OL,7,Fedge after its US-based owners Gordon
OL,8,FBrothers cut off a vital funding supply
OL,9,Fand rejected a takeover offer from
OL,10,FIrish firm Martin Property Group (MPG).
